# Config for the Auditor's approval-check over rh/cluster, read by audit-approvals.
# Assembled to /opt/agent/approval-check-cluster.env, root owned and read only, so the
# running agent cannot edit the approver list. Shell sourceable (KEY=value).
#
# GM_KEY is gm-rh, the author of rh/cluster commits: a yes must sit in a thread it
# posted in. APPROVAL_CHANNELS are the channels where gm-rh's yeses are given (#gm,
# #staff). These are the same values gm-rh itself uses. A change to any value here
# needs an approver's yes, same as any other principal change.
APPROVER_KEYS=763c87084f3b5afb6c422411601d135c57545bdc14a8d46499c1130c1b5735c1,e5abab3a573180128c205fd9b7764511c81ee641b8594e6c7acbb2f90631a0a4
GM_KEY=6c6d64a0b90c4f1dbce52c14cf05f26cc4f2ab6233576c6a23cac7e157dbde93
APPROVAL_CHANNELS=19bd0a73-ae3b-4007-8e44-a9e43f7f3710,ab32a1ee-7b21-4187-a556-de579d1c6a7a
